{
  "title": "Parallels 26上のWindows 11で、左右の⌘キーを使って日本語/英語を切り替える方法（USキーボード）",
  "basename": "2026/04/20/000706",
  "status": "Publish",
  "publishedAt": "2026-04-19T15:07:06.000Z",
  "categories": [],
  "oldPath": "/entry/2026/04/20/000706",
